    "section_faq_h3p3ep": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_EpJQ98": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is so special about the GPOD?",
            "answer": "<p>GPOD makes the lightest, strongest magnetic mounts for filming your swing. The carbon fiber monopods — the original GPOD and the GPOD X — weigh under 6 oz, and every GPOD mount shares the same adjustable MagSafe magnetic head. No flimsy plastic clamps, and nothing to cradle your phone in.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_UMTALX": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between the GPOD X and the GPOD Magsafe?",
            "answer": "<p>The <a href=\"https://gpodgolf.com/collections/frontpage/products/gpodx\">GPOD X</a> is a collapsible and extendable version of the GPOD. It can collapse to 20\" and extend to 51\" allowing the user to store in smaller bags and carry ons as well as film at different heights. The original <a href=\"https://gpodgolf.com/collections/frontpage/products/gpodmagsafe\" target=\"_blank\">GPOD for Magsafe </a>is one universal length at 41\". It was specifically engineered to meet most peoples' hand heights at address for optimal swing videos. The original GPOD requires minimal setup which makes it the easiest tool to film your game and content.  </p>"
          }
        },
        "item_qCUXAX": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between the GPOD and the GPOD mini?",
            "answer": "<p>The <a href=\"https://www.gpodgolf.com/products/gpod-mini\" target=\"_blank\">GPOD mini </a>is a magnetic clamp that attaches to an alignment stick. The GPOD has the same magnetic head, however it comes equipped with a carbon fiber body that can be inserted into the ground. The GPOD also has a 360 adjustable mount allowing one to film and view their device at any angle. The magnetic head is attached by a universal 1/4\" screw, which makes the GPOD compatible with all cameras including GoPros.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_EpJQ98",
